# cache and other artifacts produced by Lean's Lake build tool
.lake/

# scripts/ is Tau Ceti's governance machinery, copied verbatim as a local reference and ignored
# — except the two audits we have adapted and wired into the lakefile, which are ours and tracked.
# See scripts/PROVENANCE.md.
/scripts/*
!/scripts/Axioms.lean
!/scripts/ModuleSystem.lean

# TauCeti/ is Tau Ceti's contract and configuration, copied verbatim at its upstream paths, for
# reading only. Nothing tracked may point into it. See TauCeti/PROVENANCE.md.
/TauCeti/

# Literature, kept locally rather than committed
*.pdf
